  "Draft status": "Zirriborro-egoera",
  "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026": "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026",
  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Demostrazio hezigarria: HMAC-SHA256 gako partekatu batekin, eskaerari lotutako, iraungitzen diren eta egiazta daitezkeen lizentzia-tokenak erakusten dituena. Produkzio-tokenak asimetrikoki sinatu behar dira, argitaratzailearen gako publikoa /.well-known/ azpian aurkigarri izanik.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Zortzi sarrera gehiago /topics atalean, oraingoan AA agente batek ikertuta eskuz kuratatu beharrean — aurreko arau bera: iturri bakoitza eskuratu eta zuzenean berretsi, laburpenak jatorrizko parafrasi izanik, ezer gehitu aurretik. Guztira 14 sarrera.",
